# background constraints

Docs: `docs/features/gemini-llm.md`, `docs/features/html-preprocessing.md`, `docs/API-INTEGRATION.md`.

- Keep `prepareHtmlForLlm` string-only (no DOMParser in service worker)
- Preserve retry policy constants or update docs when changing backoff
- `PROCESS_HTML` listener must `return true` for async `sendResponse`
- On missing key: `LLM_ERROR` + error response without calling API
- Never log API key or full HTML
- Prompt JSON schema changes require popup/dom-updater compatibility — grep `head` / `body` field usage
